    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "W8o6Wn",
      "x": 1160,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Design notes",
      "width": 520,
      "height": 330,
      "content": "Voicetypr 2.1 redesign — rules\n\n1. Navigation 13 → 8: Home, History · SETUP: Transcription, Polish, Dictionary, Recording · Settings, Help & feedback (+ license chip).\n2. Upload folds into History (\"Transcribe a file…\"). Words/Corrections/Snippets move out of Polish into Dictionary (works without AI). Network sharing, CLI & API, Troubleshooting live under Settings → Advanced.\n3. One page header (24/600), one card (14 radius, 1px line), one row (13.5 title / 12 desc, control right). No per-screen layout systems.\n4. Every screen has one dominant region (Home: \"Press ⌥ Space and start talking\").\n5. Pill: one dark surface + sage accent; new states Pasted · N words and No text field — copied.\n6. Windows: same layout; native window controls on the right; keys shown as Alt + Space; Ctrl instead of ⌘.\n7. Tokens: bg / surface / surface-2 / sidebar / line / text / text-2 / text-3 / accent (sage) / warn / danger, light + dark."
    }
